/**
 * @mainpage Documentation de NativeVault
 *
 * # 🔒 NativeVault
 *
 * Unified Java interface for secure credential storage backed by native operating system managers.
 * Powered by the Foreign Function & Memory (FFM) API (**Project Panama**), this library provides a **zero-JNI/JNA** solution featuring strict memory hygiene (`char[]` sanitation via `Arrays.fill`).
 * It is conceptually inspired by [Microsoft's credential-secure-storage-for-java](https://github.com/microsoft/credential-secure-storage-for-java).
 *
 *
 * \section Liens_utiles Liens utiles
 * - [GitHub](https://github.com/Lob2018/native-vault)
